<title>PANAMA: SOCCER-PANAMA BEAT CUBA 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PANAMA BEAT CUBA 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PANAMA CITY 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panama beat Cuba 3-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a CONCACAF semifinal stage group two World</p>
<p>Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Panama - Victor Rene Mendieta (17th minute), Ruben Guevara</p>
<p>(55th), Jorge Luis Dely Valdez (58th)</p>
<p>Cuba - Lestor Mora (68th)</p>
<p>Final standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Canada	   6  5  1  0 10  1 16</p>
<p> El Salvador    6  3  1  2 12  6 10</p>
<p> Panama	   6  1  2  3  8 11  5</p>
<p> Cuba	     6  1  0  5  4 16  3</p>
<p>Note: Canada and El Salvador qualify for the final round</p>
<p>of the CONCACAF qualifiers.</p>
</text>
